"firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"b7d3p6iza3z11y8n7pekcoy12"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"CoreWeave五年内违约概率达63%，AI信贷风险引担忧","summary":"CoreWeave 2032年到期无担保债券跌至不足面值80%，收益率突破15%，信贷市场定价其五年内违约概率达63%。该公司合并债务及租赁义务约520亿美元，2026至2028年累计负自由现金流预计达710亿美元。分析师指出其借贷成本约9%而投资回报率仅1%，Polymarket交易员押注其2027年底前破产概率为17%。","sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://bond.eastmoney.com/news/1332,202610153896438615.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T01:49:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/0bbfd8b9f25f24983634e6e6abd82994e0befec127adb0ea475e2dab16084c08.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/7e8ce065105487100c687f545f71e93c52c1c1932a32143bdd0fb0fffc4d7d49.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"CoreWeave债券收益率逼近15%，AI借贷担忧引爆科技板块重挫","summary":null,"sourceName":"东方财富","sourceUrl":"http://stock.eastmoney.com/news/11228,202610153896114080.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T00:13:52.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"dao6gcd133h56gdbqaohwmurh"}],"citationId":"b4a5uux5oswrvm9kcuu18l7uw"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/eda78dda8cb7add69281b2fb60155ca15821ed87b36f53bee54a353f436709ba.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/47b27ccea2f9260b781ea31db02a26e2e28382a33fdb3006fd6110d8289ddc65.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/eda78dda8cb7add69281b2fb60155ca15821ed87b36f53bee54a353f436709ba.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"茶百道被强制停牌，能否复制瑞幸翻身剧本？","summary":"茶百道因IPO认购需求疑似造假被香港证监会强制停牌，涉及约43.79亿港元资产冻结，并被恒生指数公司从指数系列中剔除。与瑞幸财务造假不同，茶百道问题集中在发行环节的「兜底式操纵」，但其加盟模式决定公司无法像瑞幸那样切割创始团队稳住经营，翻盘难度更大。停牌前茶百道市值已从发行时约258.6亿港元缩水至约60亿港元，2025年加盟商流失率达17.06%。","sourceName":"钛媒体","sourceUrl":"https://www.tmtpost.com/8168817.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T03:40:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"otherSources":1,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/eda78dda8cb7add69281b2fb60155ca15821ed87b36f53bee54a353f436709ba.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/47b27ccea2f9260b781ea31db02a26e2e28382a33fdb3006fd6110d8289ddc65.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/eda78dda8cb7add69281b2fb60155ca15821ed87b36f53bee54a353f436709ba.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"茶百道因IPO疑似人为操纵需求遭港交所停牌，港股打新信任受考验","summary":null,"sourceName":"钛媒体","sourceUrl":"https://www.tmtpost.com/8169552.html","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T04:17:33.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"m46zn72akylwo8enmwig5w9cv"}],"citationId":"cboeoprvu8u26r2s4fwf1kne9"}]},{"label":"行业动态","summary":null,"items":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/79a5eb1742a839a34e8eba3975a15b3e2c76c9a88080b44a4f7703dd2968e315.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/05ff8f4aae1945ba9bb7300c7fa2755b1e21c0aba3ddfc70cd9bc11db3101fe6.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"报道：Anthropic第三季度营收168亿美元，环比增长46%，实现调整后盈利和正现金流","summary":"Anthropic向投资者披露，第三季度营收达168亿美元，较第二季度的115亿美元环比增长近50%，并在调整后口径实现盈利和正向现金流。公司在旧金山举行投资者说明会，为预计于11月启动的IPO寻求支持；AI基础设施支出压力与技术风险令投资者评估其估值时面临不确定性。","sourceName":"链捕手 ChainCatcher","sourceUrl":"https://www.chaincatcher.com/article/2296378","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T01:03:24.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":6,"related":[{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"Anthropic投资者考虑将IPO估值降至$1.5万亿，AI支出担忧加剧","summary":null,"sourceName":"Crypto Briefing","sourceUrl":"https://cryptobriefing.com/anthropic-ipo-valuation-drops-1-5-trillion/","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T21:05:28.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"zzfv3lfk01nu7kd7mjq79y05e"}],"citationId":"gvoe1c8pnziddqdwy3z5uo5a5"}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"阿斯麦Q3净利润49.6亿欧元大超预期，连续第三季上调全年指引并评估进一步扩产","summary":"阿斯麦Q3净利润49.6亿欧元，远超市场预期的41.1亿欧元，毛利率57.5%亦高于预期。公司连续第三个季度上调展望，预计Q4净销售额142亿至152亿欧元，全年毛利率约56%。部分客户已就2029至2030年设备采购表达意向，CEO Christophe Fouquet正评估在2028年30%扩产计划基础上进一步提升产能。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783594","publishedAt":"2026-10-14T05:39:22.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":3,"citationId":"kno17jnbz3mrtfgnk0tpmd9ug"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Apple收盘市值突破5万亿美元，成为全球第二家跨过该门槛的上市公司","summary":"Apple周三收盘市值达到5.005万亿美元，股价创历史新高，成为全球第二家市值突破5万亿美元的上市公司，仅次于NVIDIA。该突破发生在标普500指数下跌1.1%、Nasdaq 100指数下跌2%的背景下，此前Apple曾于7月六度盘中触及这一关口但未能收盘守住。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783658","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T00:37:35.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"yhz9ctx0rv4d44zixzzbcgllb"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"霍尔木兹海峡货船遇袭沉没，伊朗称全天候监控以色列暂缓打击伊朗","summary":"新加坡籍货轮GFS Pride在霍尔木兹海峡遭不明飞行物袭击后起火沉没，21名船员全部撤离；同周另一艘新加坡籍货轮GFS Giselle也遭袭受损。伊朗革命卫队称全天候监控波斯湾和霍尔木兹海峡，任何过境船只都必须获得许可；内塔尼亚胡表示，10月27日以色列议会选举前反对美国或以色列对伊朗发动军事打击。文章称相关袭击已推高原油风险溢价和全球租船成本。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783664","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T01:03:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"wa2jvyj8b0zy14bkkgr5vxf8e"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/2f28b8d2924d2e1af02f9354c19807c5a62d2c1c5baead9a4b34ed24c2491fb7.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/f6c9f78e45078dd1e9c20a05729886768a9dc1479ed49c96feeeb59890323758.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"WSJ：Tether向Bo Hines持股的咨询公司支付超600万美元，引发利益冲突质疑","summary":"《华尔街日报》称，前白宫加密顾问Bo Hines推动GENIUS法案期间，其共同创立并持股的咨询公司Nxum与Tether建立商业联系，Tether向Nxum支付超600万美元。Hines虽已退出日常运营，任内仍通过Signal与合伙人讨论法案；法案于2025年7月签署成法后，他于8月离职，并于9月获任Tether美国稳定币业务CEO，相关往来引发潜在利益冲突质疑。","sourceName":"PANews","sourceUrl":"https://www.panewslab.com/zh/articles/01a13d7b-8eb7-73dd-9ab7-e0a9c1555352","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T02:54:00.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"by2mhusbgxwdoj0l39059c4sd"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"CoreWeave暴跌15%，AI算力生意遭遇融资考验","summary":"CoreWeave股价周三下跌约15.46%，其债券收益率突破15%，五年期信用违约掉期成本升至约881个基点，市场定价的五年内违约概率超过50%。公司披露订单积压达1042亿美元，但分析师认为，若借款成本达到9%而项目回报仅为5%，持续依靠债务扩张可能造成价值损毁。通胀数据高于预期并推高美联储再度加息预期，Oracle、Nebius、Dell等AI基础设施相关股票及高收益债市场同步承压。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783667","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T01:21:39.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"c3f7am2nj3mn1znw7t4qax6hc"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"科技股暴跌叠加CoreWeave信用危机 10年期美债收益率跌至三周低点5.09%","summary":"10年期美债收益率周四下行10个基点至5.09%触及三周低点，MSCI亚太指数重挫逾3%，韩国综合指数暴跌9%。CoreWeave股价暴跌逾17%、2032年债券违约概率飙升至63%，引发AI板块信用风险重估。美银指出AI放缓风险正在逆转资产相关性，类似2000年互联网泡沫期间美债收益率自6.5%跌至4%的路径。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783698","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T08:14:32.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"uu1x644ukl9hjbycqhe6rni3k"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/346b778cce9e0a65daba16f325d5fbe07959b87561ecaa9068f64b2c9592cdd6.webp 48w, /hot-pages/cryptohot/data/media/93449494d1f483736790dbca11bd5d8cfd6b2eb8177f8f4254d9fbbdd51e5390.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"韩国紧急开会救市：KOSPI与KOSDAQ双双熔断，必要时随时启动应急预案","summary":"韩国KOSPI与KOSDAQ指数周四双双暴跌逾8%并触发熔断，金融服务委员会（FSC）当日紧急召开会议研判市场稳定措施。这是7月29日以来两大股指首次同日触发熔断，外资当日净卖出2.9013万亿韩元、连续第八日净卖。下跌直接诱因是美国9月CPI超预期推升美债收益率，市场对AI产业投资回报与融资条件的担忧蔓延。","sourceName":"华尔街见闻","sourceUrl":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3783692","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T06:42:34.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"citationId":"vweegokaockbpn713f9d0wbij"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"澳大利亚ASIC拟收紧加密货币交易所监管规则，设牌照申请截止日","summary":"澳大利亚证券和投资委员会（ASIC）周四启动新规咨询，要求加密货币交易所和数字资产托管机构保护客户资产、确保交易透明并满足财务要求。新规将于2027年4月8日生效，现有企业须在2027年10月7日前申请牌照，咨询期11月27日截止，最终指引预计2027年3月发布。","sourceName":"CoinDesk","sourceUrl":"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/15/australia-s-financial-watchdog-seeks-stiffer-rules-for-crypto-exchanges-ahead-of-licensing-deadline","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T09:53:37.000Z","firstParty":true,"available":true,"otherSources":2,"citationId":"jm6q5jwqvxq7i4h9ol4lq7zij"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"超5000只个股下跌 A股险守3700点","summary":"10月15日A股全市场5105只个股下跌、仅425只上涨，上证指数收报3707.48点跌1.59%，深证成指跌2.43%，创业板指跌2.92%。下跌直接原因是美国9月CPI同比上涨3.7%超预期，市场将10月加息概率由约22%抬至50%、12月一度飙升至95%以上，叠加人工智能估值泡沫担忧扩散。中信证券、国盛证券等机构预计美联储12月加息可能性更大。","sourceName":"经济观察网","sourceUrl":"http://www.eeo.com.cn/2026/1015/1065850.shtml","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T12:25:00.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"e90jqyeg4wyaip3f7oxvjmi16"},{"sourceIconUrl":null,"itemId":null,"title":"Bitcoin 一度跌破 $8 万，$9.39 亿加密清算将交易者推向 $78,000","summary":"Bitcoin 日内最低触及 $79,730 后回升至约 $82,000，美国批发通胀超预期引发加密市场抛售，近 $9.39 亿清算涉及 176,506 名交易者。","sourceName":"CryptoSlate","sourceUrl":"https://cryptoslate.com/bitcoins-100000-dream-slips-away-as-939-million-crypto-wipeout-pushes-traders-toward-78000/","publishedAt":"2026-10-15T17:30:25.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"a1hurip1pld4qdjym67eaz7ug"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":12,"sourcesCount":8,"firstPartyEvents":9},"readingMinutes":5,"prev":"2026-10-15","next":"2026-10-17"}